## 중앙 책임 1: `NinjaLive`

### 관찰된 구조

- component 4개: `NinjaLiveComponent`, `ActivationVolume`,
  `InteractionVolume`, `EditorIcon`.
- graph 23개, node 1,013개, link 1,105개, truncation 0.
- variable 57개, category 9개, instance-editable 28개.
- `EventGraph`의 asset comment는 actor의 주목적을 mouse-hit과 object-overlap
  탐지/관리, 그리고 component가 가진 interaction list의 add/remove라고 직접
  설명한다.
- 변수 tooltip은 actor가 primitive/skeletal point 입력의 overlap discovery를
  담당하지만 fields, particles, destructibles는 component가 직접 담당한다고
  구분한다.

### Event와 책임 흐름

| 흐름 | 직접 관찰 | target 의미 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| construction | editor icon/volume visibility, activation/interaction volume 크기, legacy trace mesh 선택 | authoring visualization과 runtime policy를 분리 |
| begin play | `OwnerRePlayEvent` bind, actor/component disable 전달, volume collision/visibility, exclusion array 구성 | host initialization이 lifecycle controller를 호출 |
| replay | `ResetTempArrays` 뒤 begin-play와 유사한 volume/filter 재구성 | replay를 명시적 reset transition으로 구현 |
| tick/proximity | custom tick-rate 구간, activation volume 상태, `OwnerRePlayEvent`, `ComponentRePlayEvent`, `ComponentShutdownEvent` 호출 | proximity policy는 solver가 아니라 lifecycle gate가 소유 |
| mouse/touch | press/touch state와 hit validity 검사; comment는 실제 hit position 계산이 component에 있다고 명시 | host는 screen hit validity, input adapter는 domain sample을 소유 |
| begin overlap | primitive와 skeletal component를 tag/object type으로 거르고 pivot/bone 추적 목록에 추가 | discovery와 sample extraction을 분리 |
| end overlap | 목록에서 제거하되 runtime collision이 `NoCollision`로 바뀌는 ragdoll 예외를 선택적으로 유지 | source registry는 stable source ID와 removal policy를 가짐 |
| initial overlap | 이미 volume 안에 spawn된 actor와 `GenerateOverlapEvents=false` 엔진 동작의 보정 | explicit initial scan fixture 필요 |
| capacity/filter | large object, pawn/vehicle, collision type, temp-array capacity filter | input budget과 rejection reason을 진단 가능하게 구현 |

근거 graph는 `EventGraph`, `MouseAndTouch`, `InitialOverlapCheck`,
`BeginOverlapDetection`, `EndOverlapDetection`, `SimContainerCapacityFilter1`,
`UE5 - SetInteractionVolumeCollisionResponse`다.

### 변수/default family

| family | 수 / editable | 대표 default | 관찰된 계약 |
| --- | ---: | --- | --- |
| `Live Activation` | 7 / 7 | disabled `false`, proximity activation `false`, volume `(50,50,50)m`, check `0.1s`, activator `Pawn` | initialize/pause/replay/shutdown gate |
| `Live Interaction` | 16 / 13 | user-input enum value `1`, overlap `true`, volume `(5,5,1)m`, 4 object types, auto-exclude-large `true` | mouse/touch와 overlap source selection |
| `LiveLegacy` | 4 / 4 | trace size `(1,1,1)`, show in editor `true`, trace-as-volume `false` | legacy trace/display compatibility |
| `Live Debug` | 4 / 4 | activation print `false`, capacity warning `true`, log `false`, lifetime `8s` | diagnostics only |
| non-public interaction | 8 / 0 | component/actor arrays empty, touch lookup 10, initial processed `false` | transient registry state |
| non-public system/helpers/components | 17 / 0 | tick `0.016s`, init `false`, helper strength `1`, object refs null | transient lifecycle and forwarding state |
| delegate | 1 / 0 | `OwnerRePlayEvent` | host-owner replay signal |
| **합계** | **57 / 28** |  | authoring config와 transient state가 같은 asset에 섞여 있음 |

### Graph family

| family | exact graph 표지 |
| --- | --- |
| lifecycle/authoring | `UserConstructionScript`, `EventGraph`, `Set Pawn Proximity behaviour`, `OwnerRePlayEvent`, `PRINT STATUS` |
| registry/temp storage | `ResetTempArrays`, `GetTempArray`, `ClearNinjaLiveComponentInteractionLists`, `MakeInitialActorsArray`, `FakeInitialActorsArray` |
| filtering | `ExcludeLargeObjects`, `FilterPawnsAndVehicles`, `CollisionTypeFilter1/2`, `SimContainerCapacityFilter1`, `InitialOvelapVSDynamicOverlapActors` |
| user and overlap input | `MouseAndTouch`, `InitialOverlapCheck`, `BeginOverlapDetection`, `EndOverlapDetection` |
| volume/collision | `UE5 - SetInteractionVolumeCollisionResponse`, `InteractionVolumeTransform` |
| explicitly non-production | `UnusedMethods` comment가 method를 `NOT USED`로 표시 |

## 중앙 책임 2: `NinjaLiveComponent`

### 관찰된 구조

- graph 87개, node 6,004개, link 6,519개, truncation 0.
- variable 538개, category 57개, instance-editable 330개.
- `Preset` tooltip에는 component user-exposed 변수 329개, actor 변수 24개라고
  적혀 있지만 현재 구조 캡처의 `instance_editable=true`는 각각 330개와
  28개다. 이 차이는 source 설명과 현재 asset 구조의 불일치로 기록하며
  runtime/default manifest 전에는 어느 쪽도 정답으로 고정하지 않는다.
- 가장 큰 graph는 `PresetReadWrite` 2,001 node/2,460 link,
  `SetParams` 886/810, `EventGraph` 482/386,
  `CreateOuputMaterialAndSetItOnTargets` 452/526이다.
- `SetParams`는 107 float, 60 bool, 16 texture, 14 int, 10 object Niagara
  setter 호출을 직접 포함한다. 이는 authoring state를 Niagara runtime namespace로
  변환하는 parameter bridge 책임의 근거다.

### Event와 책임 흐름

| entry/event | 직접 관찰 | target 의미 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `Event Begin Play` | replay/shutdown delegate bind, preset read/write, `SetParams`, Niagara activate/render/visibility 경로 | ordered lifecycle pipeline 필요 |
| `RePlay` | preset 적용, parameter set, transient arrays/state reset, re-activate | reset policy와 preserve/flush policy를 명시 |
| `LiveActivation` interface event | component/owner disable와 tick blockers, brush/density temp, replay/shutdown delegate 경로 | string command를 typed lifecycle command로 대체 |
| `LiveFluidParams` interface event | `GlobalBrushSize` 갱신 | typed interaction tuning command로 대체 |
| `ReceiveParticleData` | Niagara callback data와 simulation offset을 받아 position/vector arrays를 관리하는 경로 | particle callback adapter가 canonical point sample을 생성 |
| `Shutdown` | Niagara deactivate, component tick/render/visibility off | idempotent shutdown contract |
| `EditorMode` / `SaveBuffers` | editor dispatcher와 save-buffer collapsed graph 연결 | editor-only authoring action과 runtime core를 분리 |
| `Event End Play` | 별도 end-play sequence와 추가 Niagara/console cleanup graph 표지 | delegate/timer/input/output cleanup을 한 owner가 보장 |

`Event Tick` node 자체는 캡처에서 exec와 data output link가 0개다. 대신
`UseUnrealNativeTick`, timer/LOD graph와 Niagara callback 경로가 보인다. 실제
runtime update cadence가 timer, Niagara callback, component tick 중 무엇을
우선하는지는 현재 구조만으로 확정하지 않는다.

### 변수/default domain

`Live*` category prefix를 책임 단위로 합산했다. 이 표는 538개를 빠짐없이
포함한다.

| domain | 수 / editable | 대표 default와 계약 |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| delegates | 6 / 0 | replay, memory, shutdown, world offset, editor, save-buffer multicast |
| core/lifecycle/performance/transform | 70 / 64 | `256x256`, extents `(5,5,1)m`, sim speed `1`, native tick `true`, pause-not-visible `true`, paint downscale `2`, field downscale `4`, interaction cap `16000`, Data Channel cap `4000` |
| editor tools | 6 / 4 | preset refresh `1s`, continuous read `false`, editor mode `false` |
| input fields | 85 / 78 | field persistence `0.2`; bitmap/cache/SDF/height/RVT/spline/destructible adapters는 대부분 opt-in `false` |
| input points | 49 / 46 | global/primitive/skeletal/particle brush size `1`, strength `1`, hardness `0`, puncture `0.05`, Data Channel reader `true` |
| simulation | 49 / 49 | density accumulation `0.85`, brush velocity `1`, divergence `1`, pressure feedback `1`, velocity feedback `0.99` |
| output | 64 / 60 | painter export `false`, velocity-density `true`, pressure-divergence `true`; RT refs null; F/H/S volume render `false` |
| legacy | 37 / 29 | raymarch, slow underwater postprocess, unused compatibility switches; 주요 기능 기본 off |
| temp | 3 / 0 | temporary material/name state |
| non-public | 169 / 0 | interaction arrays 40개, runtime component refs, MID/RT maps, geometry collection and transform state |
| **합계** | **538 / 330** | public authoring, derived runtime, transient state가 단일 component에 혼재 |

### Function/graph family

| family | exact graph 표지와 직접 관찰 |
| --- | --- |
| lifecycle/editor | `Editor Mode ON/OFF`, `Restart Sim`, `Stop`, `EventGraph`, `Initial Disable`, `Set Timers`, `DELAY IF LEGACYMODE`, start/end console command, additional Niagara stop, replay/shutdown/editor/save delegates |
| preset/config | `PresetReadWrite`, `PresetRead`, `PresetWrite`, `LegacyPresetLoader`, `ParsePresetMapAndSetVariables`, `XLegacySetupConversion`, `SetSystemVariables` |
| core binding/buffer | `SetParams`, `SetNiagaraCore`, `CreateRenderTargets`, `RenderTargetValidityCheck`, `SaveSimulationBuffers`, `LegacyRenderTargetExport`, `FlushNiagaraGCBuffer` |
| point input | `Manage Point-like Inputs...`, `ManageContinousInteractions`, `Enable OWNER Input`, `CaptureMouse`, touch/single-input checks, multi-object cycles, brush size/position functions, bone debug |
| field input | `Manage Field-like Inputs...`, `CollectSplineActors`, world-static check, spline/mesh/height/texture/destructible blocks inside `SetParams` |
| domain/LOD | `Conditionally double Z`, `CameraFacingFunction`, `LOD-DistaceStepsPrecalc`, `FPS-PRECISION-RESOLUTION`, `ProximityActivation-MasterVars-Quantizer-OutMat`, `LOD`, `ConstructSimPosition`, position/rotation/world-offset delegates |
| output | `CreateOuputMaterialAndSetItOnTargets`, `OutputMaterialUpdate`, `ADD SVOL COMPONENT`, `SET HVOL/FVOL MATERIAL TO NIAGARA`, `RaymarchBasedLightingOPs`, output RT graphs |
| diagnostics/guards | `STATUS`, `CompareMapLength`, `CheckLength`, `Blocker1/2`, facing/light debug graphs, `Repeater` |

### Preset serialization boundary

`NinjaPreset`은 변수 301개, category 47개, instance-editable 300개를 가지며
유일한 `EventGraph`는 node 0이다. `PresetReadWrite`의 graph comment는 actor
reference를 preset에 저장할 수 없음을 반복해서 표시한다. 따라서 target
preset은 runtime object reference를 직렬화하지 않고, asset soft reference나
level binding key처럼 독립적으로 검증 가능한 값만 담는다. 301개를 그대로
복제하지 않고 위 variable domain별 typed struct로 나누되, 실제 저장 대상은
preset/runtime round-trip fixture로 확정한다.

## Clean-room target interface와 책임 ledger

아래 facade/support package mapping은 `source-to-target-ledger.md`의 canonical
결정과 일치한다. 원본 graph, package 수, node 배치, GUID를 복제하지 않는다.
모든 행의 구현 상태는 `pending`이고 현재 method는 `concept-only`다. 내부 owner
경로는
`/Game/Study/CubeFluidNinjaLive` 기준 상대 경로다.

| Responsibility ID | 관찰된 source 책임 | canonical facade / internal owner | 입력 contract | 출력 contract | acceptance 전제 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `CFNL-BP-RSP-001` | actor shell과 두 volume | root `NinjaLive` compatibility facade | domain transform, source-compatible calls, optional activation policy | lifecycle 요청과 source-discovery bounds | actor scale과 volume size 분리, fixed fixture transform 일치 |
| `CFNL-BP-RSP-002` | begin/replay/pause/shutdown, tick blockers | `Blueprints/Core/BPC_CFNL_Lifecycle` | typed command와 transition context | explicit state, replay/shutdown delegates | idempotent transition, reset/flush 결과 수치 비교 |
| `CFNL-BP-RSP-003` | `LiveActivation`/`LiveFluidParams` source-compatible interface | `Blueprints/Core/BPI_CFNL_Control` facade + root `NinjaLiveComponent` receiver | exact legacy pins/defaults at boundary; typed command/request after receipt | internal applied/rejected diagnostics | exact caller compile + reference command fixture의 visible state/brush response 일치 |
| `CFNL-BP-RSP-004` | 6-function library, legacy row/table, 301-var preset와 2,001-node map read/write | `Blueprints/Core/BFL_CFNL_LiveFunctions`, `Data/Structs`, `Data/Presets`, `Blueprints/Core/BPC_CFNL_ConfigResolver` | exact six public function contracts + safe default/preset/override | immutable canonical config + validation report | legacy 37-row lookup, function caller compile, precedence/round-trip fixture 통과 |
| `CFNL-BP-RSP-005` | overlap/tag/type/initial scan registry | `Blueprints/Input/BPC_CFNL_SourceRegistry` | bounds, tags, object types, explicit include/exclude | stable source IDs와 add/remove events | spawn-inside, ragdoll, duplicate-bone, large-object fixture 통과 |
| `CFNL-BP-RSP-006` | mouse/touch, pivot, bone, particle point collection | `Blueprints/Input/BPC_CFNL_PointInputRouter` | raw hit/component/bone/particle data | canonical point samples with transform, velocity, radius, lifetime | source별 위치·속도·brush footprint 비교 |
