| `CFNL-BP-RSP-010` | material target 수집, MID 생성, RT/material binding | `Blueprints/Output/BPC_CFNL_OutputRouter` | exported buffer views와 material recipe | target-local MID bindings | output 변경이 solver state를 바꾸지 않고 화면 비교 통과 |
| `CFNL-BP-RSP-011` | mesh, FVOL, HVOL, SVOL, camera-facing/light | `Blueprints/Output` presenter components | output view, domain transform, renderer recipe | renderer component state | renderer family별 fixed-camera parity |
| `CFNL-BP-RSP-012` | landscape/mesh/spline/Niagara external drive | `Blueprints/Output/BP_CFNL_ExternalDriver` | output view, sim transform, target selectors | target material/Niagara parameters | multiple-host ownership/replay competition fixture 통과 |
