| `CFNL-BP-RSP-014` | debug, editor buttons, capture, UI | `Blueprints/Validation` 전용 fixture/harness | diagnostics request, fixed camera/input/time | structured metrics, screenshots, logs | shipping/runtime graph와 분리, 저장 상태 오염 0 |
